<title>USA: U.S. DAP, ammonia prices little changed.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP, ammonia prices little changed.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices for diammonium phosphate (DAP) and ammonia were little changed from Monday, cash sources said.</p>
<p>They noted movement of DAP to eastern Corn Belt states remained fairly active with corn planting seen gathering pace later this month and in early May. High water levels continued to restrict the flow of supplies up the Misssissippi River.</p>
<p>			   Dlrs/short ton	 Chg from Monday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla		175-177	     dn 1-unc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf	  188-189	     unc-dn 1</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf		170-172		  unc</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
